---
import { site } from '@data/site';
---

<section class="contact-cta section">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Private Consultation</p>
      <h2>讓一顆鑽石，成為你們故事裡最清楚的光。</h2>
      <p>歡迎透過 LINE、電話或 Email 預約諮詢。我們會依預算、配戴習慣、證書需求與紀念意義，協助整理選擇。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a class="button" href={site.lineUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">加入 LINE 諮詢</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">查看聯絡資訊</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-cta {
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contact-cta h2 {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cta-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
